This documentation outlines the approach for testing the Invoice Management service using Gauge as a Behavior-Driven Development (BDD) testing framework, Datafaker for generating fake data, AssertJ for JUnit-style assertions, and Spring Boot for dependency injection. The Invoice Management service is a Spring Boot-based RESTful application that accepts HTTP POST requests at the /invoices endpoint and subsequently invokes Oracle EBS to create AP (accounts payable) transactions, such as invoices.

